  "Description": {
    "Cost": 1167575,
    "UIName": "Ajax",
    "Id": "chassisdef_ajax_AJX-X1",
    "Name": "Ajax",
    "Details": "A prototype LAM, the Ajax was a next generation Star League design. Following relatively successful initial trials, the Amaris Civil War rendered the design extinct, with production and testing ceasing due to the war. Designed to be easy to maintain, the Ajax uses pod mounted weapons similar to the modular weapons designed for the Mercury scout 'Mech. Though able to switch modes faster than standard LAM designs, particularly heavy loadouts still hinder the Ajax's speed and versatility.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>",
    "Icon": "ajaxLAM"
  },
